<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in late N.Y., Dow firms.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in late N.Y., Dow firms.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in late New York trade, where by 9.25 a.m. NZT the Dow had gained 33.54 points to 6,497.85.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company     Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail   N.Y.    US$17 5/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$29 5/8	 -0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$28 3/8	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	 N.Y.    US$19 7/8	 +0 5/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$15 3/4	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$82 3/4	 -0 7/8 *</p>
<p>Evergreen   N.Y. untraded. Last at traded at 8 3/8</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  174		   +1</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  32 1/2		+1/2</p>
<p>Brierley	 London  untraded</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  238		   nil</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col London  153		   -1/4</p>
<p>Templeton	London  130		   +2 1/4</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  A$3.00		n/a</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.60		n/a</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$2.90		n/a</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares. Evergreen is in bundles of 20.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
